// Package centre relative to the lower-left corner of the pattern outline
// (bounding box over all package outer edges):
//   X = KxL*KL + KxB*KB + KxD*D
//   Y = KyL*KL + KyB*KB + KyD*D
// KL = long side, KB = short side of the package, D = safety gap [mm].
// The order of the packages within a pattern is NOT the placement order;
// the PLC computes the placement order itself.
// ======================================================================

TYPE "UDT_LayerPackage"
VERSION : 1.0
   STRUCT
      BaseOrientation : USInt;   // 0 = KL along pattern X, 90 = KL along pattern Y
